      "title_at_revision": "Fuel system lightning protection.",
      "text": "[The fuel system must be designed and arranged to prevent the ignition of fuel vapor within the system by--\n(a) Direct lightning strikes to area having a high probability of stroke attachment:\n(b) Swept lightning strokes on area where swept strokes are highly probable; and\n(c) Corona or streamering at fuel vent outlets.]",
